    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const projects = $('Gather Projects').all().map(i => i.json);\nconst tasks = $('Gather Mission Tasks').all().map(i => i.json);\nconst emails = $('Gather Recent Emails').all().map(i => i.json);\nconst lines = [];\n\nlines.push('== PROJECTS ==');\nif (projects.length === 0) { lines.push('(no projects yet)'); }\nfor (const p of projects) {\n  lines.push(p.project_code + ' | ' + p.status + ' | payment:' + p.payment_status + ' | ' + (p.customer_name || '') + ' | ' + (p.requirements_summary || '').slice(0, 60));\n}\n\nlines.push('== MISSION TASKS ==');\nif (tasks.length === 0) { lines.push('(no missions yet)'); }\nfor (const t of tasks) {\n  lines.push(t.mission_code + '#' + t.seq + ' [' + t.status + '] ' + t.title + ' (' + t.assigned_agent + ')');\n}\n\nlines.push('== RECENT EMAILS (last 2 days, max 10) ==');\nif (emails.length === 0) { lines.push('(none)'); }\nfor (const e of emails) {\n  const from = typeof e.from === 'object' ? ((e.from.value && e.from.value[0] && (e.from.value[0].name || e.from.value[0].address)) || '') : String(e.from || '');\n  lines.push((e.date || '').slice(0, 10) + ' | ' + from.slice(0, 40) + ' | ' + String(e.subject || '').slice(0, 90));\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { brief_input: lines.join('\\n').slice(0, 9000) } }];"
      },
      "id": "g1000006-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Summarize Inputs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        496,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are the SESEMI daily briefing writer for the agency owner. Today is {{ $now.setZone('Asia/Yerevan').toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd dddd') }}.\n\nFrom the RAW DATA below, write a Persian (Farsi) morning brief as Telegram HTML (tags: <b>, <i>, <code>). Max 2200 characters. Structure:\n\n☀️ <b>گزارش صبح SESEMI</b>\n📁 <b>پروژه‌ها:</b> one line: counts per status (e.g. ۲ در انتظار تأیید، ۱ در حال ساخت) + any project needing owner attention\n🎯 <b>مأموریت‌ها:</b> per mission: progress x/y + the currently active task; mention blocked/failed ones first\n📬 <b>ایمیل‌های ۲ روز اخیر:</b> only the important ones (work/security/receipts) one line each; group the rest as «N مورد تبلیغاتی»\n🎯 <b>اقدام امروز:</b> top 1-3 concrete actions for the owner (or «اقدام خاصی لازم نیست»)\n\nBe specific, use real names/numbers from the data, never invent content. If a section is empty, say so briefly. Output ONLY the HTML message.\n\nRAW DATA:\n{{ $json.brief_input }}",
        "batching": {}
      },
